SPECIFIC RISKS RELATED TO OUR COMMON STOCK
Our stock price may be volatile or may decline regardless of our operating performance, and you may not be able to resell your shares at or above the price at which you
purchase it.
The stock market generally, and our stock in particular with a beta of 2.25, has experienced price and volume fluctuations. As a result of this volatility, you might not be able to sell
your common stock at or above the price at which you purchased it. The public market for our stock is new. From our Regulation A Offering on September 21, 2017 through March
24, 2023, the per share trading price of our common stock has been as high as $733.00 and as low as $1.33. It might continue to fluctuate significantly in response to various factors,
